Package: dot-os-icon-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, breeze-icon-theme, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: monoline icons mapped to freedesktop names
 Monoline icons at a 1.5 pixel stroke, drawn from Lucide and mapped to
 freedesktop icon names. Falls back to Breeze for anything not covered.
